# Development values, read by StartDev. Keep the file private.
#
# Keys use the standard .NET form Section__Key (Rss__TimeoutSeconds -> Rss:TimeoutSeconds) and reach
# the API container.
# Production values go in .env, read by StartProd; the two modes share nothing else.

# A GitHub token with read:packages; downloads the CompanyHQ packages when the API is built.
# Leave it empty to use the GitHub CLI login instead.
COMPANYHQ_PACKAGES_TOKEN=
